  "body": "Gecko recently made a change to not actually do autofocusing bits until after pending stylesheets have loaded, to prevent flashes of unstyled content.\r\n\r\nIt's not clear to me that the current spec language (which required queueing a task as soon as the autofocus element is inserted into the DOM) allows this behavior.  Should it?",
